# Per-tenant reviewed policy: names the tenant, subscription, workspace and app
# registrations. Only the example template is tracked. Allowlist, not blocklist:
# per-tenant files accumulate with arbitrary names (NEWGN-, OLDGN-, ...) and a
# blocklist misses every one that was not anticipated.
